-- The three platform-wide entities the relayout (2026-10-02) rewrote in the seed JSON but not in content-seed.mysql.sql:
-- `map` (terrain layer), `characters` (character images), `asset-requests` (wanted paths) still pointed at the old
-- folders (catpope/images/…), which are gone from the CDN – the map and the character images 404 on the new platform.
-- Found by server/tests/entities-compare.php against api.scutoons.com (CUTOVER 6.1). content-seed.mysql.sql now carries the
-- new JSON as well (a fresh database gets it directly; this file then does nothing).
-- Idempotent: inserts the new published version only while the published one still has an old path, then turns that one
-- into a draft. Same JSON as shared/content/seed/scutoons/_/{map,characters,asset-requests}.json.
SET NAMES utf8mb4;
